      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “local authority or an institution or organization” perkataan “or a fund”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam proviso, dengan menggantikan perkataan “or organization” dengan perkataan “, organization or fund”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (7), dengan memasukkan sebelum takrif “institution” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “fund” means a fund administered and augmented by an institution or organization in Malaysia for the sole purpose of carrying out the objectives for which the fund is established or held and that fund is not established or held primarily for profit;’;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/18/msa@/~chp_II__cl_8__para_c",
